cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QPU Latency Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark suite that decomposes the wall time of quantum jobs into
  submission overhead and quantum execution, by sweeping shots, circuits
  per submission, circuit depth and circuit width, and fitting a timing
  model per platform.
type: software
authors:
